    "\n",
    "Go to the WashU Political Science people page:\n",
    "\n",
    "https://polisci.washu.edu/people?cat=88&letter=All\n",
    "\n",
    "For the basic exercise, scrape only the faculty cards that are already available when the page first loads. 
    "\n",
    "For each person, go to their individual profile page and create a `.csv` file with:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Name\n",
    "- Title\n",
    "- E-mail\n",
    "- Web page\n",
    "- Specialization\n",
    "  - If a field is missing, leave it blank.\n",
