    "## Challenge: Load More + Deduplicate\n",
    "\n",
    "The current people page does not show every result at once. Additional cards appear after clicking **\"Load more.\"**\n",
    "\n",
    "Extend your scraper so that it:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Opens the people page with Selenium.\n",
    "2. Keeps clicking **\"Load more\"** until the button is gone.\n",
    "3. Collects the faculty cards from the fully loaded page.\n",
    "4. Removes duplicate people before visiting individual profile pages.\n",
    "   - Use the profile URL (`href`) as the identifier for a person.\n",
    "5. Scrapes the same five fields as in the Basic exercise and saves them to a second `.csv` file.\n",
    "\n",
    "A useful check is to print the number of cards before and after removing duplicates.\n"
